{
 "_doc": "fid29 combat (build 29): captured motion for the mid and high tiers only (combat_animator.gd, look real + fid_combat), in new libraries anim/real/<key>.glb; build 28's anim/*.glb and data/anim_clips.json are untouched (low phones load them). Per hero: hit = the additive directional hit reactions (layered on the spine, neck and arms by pose_layer.gd, never played as a state); states = the state a captured clip stands in for (its length and event times are the build 28 clip's: 'replaces'); variants = clips a looping state may play instead of its build 28 clip, picked by a hash of the fighter's slot and its count (never the fight's RNG). Written by tools/anim/build_real.py.",
